Kimi Code CLI is developed by Moonshot AI and distributed under the MIT License.
This runtime uses the official npm @moonshot-ai/kimi-code distribution, pinned to 2.1.1.
Installed upstream files are unmodified. SelfMe Lab's steering-loader.mjs extends
the loaded ACP transport in memory to expose native agent.steer and prevent
an idle/cancelled steering request from launching a new task. Dependencies and
registry integrity hashes are recorded in package-lock.json.
Source: https://github.com/MoonshotAI/kimi-code
